<title>JAPAN: Kanto Biomedical to buy back Y450 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Kanto Biomedical to buy back Y450 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kanto Biomedical Laboratory Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it plans to buy back 450 million yen worth of its shares, or 250,000 shares, in order to introduce a stock option scheme for its employees.</p>
<p>The Japanese firm, which is involved in clinical experiments, said in a statement that its board has decided to introduce stock options which give holders the right to buy shares at a set price within a certain period of time.</p>
</text>
